\"justify-content:center;\">\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image.png\" alt=\"Image\" class=\"h3967-card-img\" style=\"aspect-ratio:291/291;\" />\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107311.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810731\" class=\"h3967-card-img\" style=\"aspect-ratio:291/394;\" />\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Column 5 (Frame 2147230206) -->\n      <div class=\"h3967-col\">\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810729.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810729\" class=\"h3967-card-img\" style=\"aspect-ratio:291/291;\" />\n\n        <!-- Frame 2147230307: Research document card -->\n        <div class=\"h3967-research-card\" style=\"aspect-ratio:291/393;\">\n          <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810727.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px;\" />\n          <div class=\"h3967-research-inner\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:6.5px;line-height:1.2;color:#5a5a87;margin-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.4px;\">Special Report</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;color:#29293e;margin-bottom:5px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\">Nutrition of Teenage Girls and Women in Humanitarian Crises</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:6px;line-height:1.2;color:#29293e;margin-bottom:7px;\">By Dr. Heather Esme-Collins MBBS, MRCPCH, MMed</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:6.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#29293e;margin-bottom:5px;\">Global humanitarian crises have reached unprecedented scale and complexity, with the world now facing the most severe food and nutrition crisis in modern history. In just three years since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic, the number of people in need of humanitarian assistance has surged from 168 million to an alarming 339 million.</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:6.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#29293e;margin-bottom:5px;\">Humanitarian crises are growing more severe, disruptive, and prolonged than ever before. Many countries are confronting overlapping shocks — conflict and instability, extreme weather events like extended droughts or severe flooding, and disease outbreaks such as cholera.</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:6.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#29293e;margin-bottom:10px;\">All of this places a disproportionate burden on adolescent girls and women, worsening their ability to find, access, and afford nutritious food and essential nutrition services.</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:5.5px;color:#08080b;margin-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">Over, Under: Nourishment at a Glance</div>\n            <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image3860.png\" alt=\"Chart: Number of acutely malnourished pregnant and breastfeeding women in 12 countries affected by the food and nutrition crisis, 2020 and 2022\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block;\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col4img02.png\" alt=\"col-4 image\" class=\"h3967-card-img\" style=\"aspect-ratio:292/394;\" />\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107241.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810724\" class=\"h3967-card-img\" style=\"aspect-ratio:291/393;\" />\n      </div>\n\n    </div><!-- /Gallery -->\n\n  </div><!-- /inner wrapper -->\n</section>",
      "authorContentHtml": "<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-navBarContainer.png\" alt=\"Nav Bar Container\"></picture>\nPDF &amp; Productivity\n<h1>With great power comes great productivity.</h1>\n          <p>Do your best work faster with AI-powered document insights, secure collaboration, and professional content creation — all in one place.</p>\nTry Acrobat Studio\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-plus.png\" alt=\"Plus\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810732.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810732\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle2147231490.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n          <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image3587.png\" alt=\"Signature image\"></picture>\n          Sign\n          Signature\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810731.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810731\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107321.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810732\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col2img02.png\" alt=\"col-2 image\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810724.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810724\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810734.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810734\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col5img02.png\" alt=\"col-5 image\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810735.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810735\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image.png\" alt=\"Image\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107311.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810731\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810729.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810729\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810727.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\nSpecial Report\n            Nutrition of Teenage Girls and Women in Humanitarian Crises\n            By Dr. Heather Esme-Collins MBBS, MRCPCH, MMed\n            Global humanitarian crises have reached unprecedented scale and complexity, with the world now facing the most severe food and nutrition crisis in modern history. In just three years since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic, the number of people in need of humanitarian assistance has surged from 168 million to an alarming 339 million.\n            Humanitarian crises are growing more severe, disruptive, and prolonged than ever before. Many countries are confronting overlapping shocks — conflict and instability, extreme weather events like extended droughts or severe flooding, and disease outbreaks such as cholera.\n            All of this places a disproportionate burden on adolescent girls and women, worsening their ability to find, access, and afford nutritious food and essential nutrition services.\n            Over, Under: Nourishment at a Glance\n            <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image3860.png\" alt=\"Chart: Number of acutely malnourished pregnant and breastfeeding women in 12 countries affected by the food and nutrition crisis, 2020 and 2022\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col4img02.png\" alt=\"col-4 image\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107241.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810724\"></picture>",
